WEBVTT

00:01.257 --> 00:04.007
<b>I have been expecting you, Yasuie.</b>

00:04.087 --> 00:07.047
<b>It has been a long time, Sir Kinmune.</b>

00:07.137 --> 00:15.837
<b>MAJOR COUNSELOR
KINMUNE SAIONJI</b>

00:07.607 --> 00:10.717
<b><i>Kinmune Saionji, Major Counselor.</i></b>

00:10.807 --> 00:12.507
<b><i>He came from a court noble family</i></b>

00:12.507 --> 00:15.187
<b><i>that had served for generations
as a link between Kamakura and Kyo.</i></b>

00:16.057 --> 00:18.937
<b>How I miss the days
when the shogunate still stood.</b>

00:19.977 --> 00:24.657
<b>In those days, all the court nobles in Kyo
heeded my every word.</b>

00:27.517 --> 00:31.147
<b>TOKIYUKI</b>

00:27.657 --> 00:31.657
<b>Chojumaru. I have important matters
to discuss with him.</b>

00:31.657 --> 00:34.827
<b>You must be eager to see Kyo.</b>

00:35.667 --> 00:36.957
<b>When I was young,</b>

00:37.037 --> 00:40.337
<b>I used to hide my identity
and have all sorts of fun in Kyo.</b>

00:40.417 --> 00:43.007
<b>Just make sure no one blows your cover.</b>

00:43.797 --> 00:46.837
<b>What exactly are they planning?</b>

00:46.927 --> 00:47.927
<b>No idea.</b>

00:48.007 --> 00:51.267
<b>He said they were planning an uprising,
but if he's discussing it</b>

00:51.347 --> 00:53.847
<b>with a high-ranking noble,
it must be something big.</b>

00:53.927 --> 00:56.397
<b>Sounds pretty serious.</b>

00:56.477 --> 00:58.517
<b>But setting that aside…</b>

01:00.977 --> 01:02.727
<b>We're in Kyo!</b>

01:21.127 --> 01:26.467
<b>THE ELUSIVE SAMURAI</b>

02:41.667 --> 02:42.827
<b>Wow!</b>

02:42.917 --> 02:43.997
<b>Make way!</b>

02:44.087 --> 02:45.707
<b>A noble lady is in a hurry!</b>

02:46.757 --> 02:48.127
<b>Are you all right, My Lord?</b>

02:51.837 --> 02:54.217
<b>What's that? That eel is huge!</b>

02:55.257 --> 02:56.677
<b>It's pike conger.</b>

02:59.057 --> 03:01.187
<b>Look how carefully he's cutting the bones.</b>

03:01.897 --> 03:04.897
<b>Is it really worth that much trouble?</b>

03:14.577 --> 03:16.947
<b><i>It's absolutely worth the trouble!</i></b>

03:19.617 --> 03:21.037
<b>Wait. Where's Fubuki?</b>

03:21.117 --> 03:23.577
<b>He said he was out of money,
so he'd earn some first.</b>

03:24.077 --> 03:26.037
<b>"They're putting up new buildings
all over the city,</b>

03:26.127 --> 03:28.257
<b>so it'll be easy to find work
as a laborer.</b>

03:28.757 --> 03:32.177
<b>And the wages are much higher
than in Suwa or Kamakura," he said.</b>

03:40.557 --> 03:42.267
<b>Well, well.</b>

03:42.347 --> 03:44.807
<b>-Aren't you adorable in that fox mask?
-Ba-dump!</b>

03:44.897 --> 03:47.437
<b>Why don't you come have some fun with us?</b>

03:49.897 --> 03:51.897
<b><i>I just got hit on
by the ladies of Kyo! But why?</i></b>

03:51.987 --> 03:54.947
<b><i>Was my refinement showing
through the mask?</i></b>

03:55.027 --> 03:58.197
<b><i>Or does a man with money
just get more attention from women?</i></b>

03:58.867 --> 04:00.247
<b>I'm gonna take off for a bit, brat.</b>

04:00.867 --> 04:02.407
<b>I'll be back by tonight…</b>

04:02.497 --> 04:05.827
<b>No, actually, I don't know
if I'll even be back by morning.</b>

04:06.377 --> 04:09.417
<b>Be a good boy and run along to bed!</b>

04:10.047 --> 04:12.337
<b>I despise loquat seeds!</b>

04:12.417 --> 04:14.657
<b>KIYOMIZU-DERA TEMPLE</b>

04:12.607 --> 04:18.507
<b>Those wretched seeds ruin the texture
of an otherwise perfect fruit!</b>

04:18.597 --> 04:23.187
<b>Merciful Buddha, rid every loquat
in this world of its seeds!</b>

04:23.267 --> 04:26.017
<b>Stop it. Let go!
Enough about the seeds already!</b>

04:26.097 --> 04:27.607
<b>That's Kyo for you.</b>

04:27.687 --> 04:30.527
<b>The people here are way weirder
than anyone back in Shinano.</b>

04:30.607 --> 04:31.607
<b>Yeah…</b>

04:35.277 --> 04:36.617
<b><i>It's almost overwhelming.</i></b>

04:38.197 --> 04:41.787
<b><i>Its size and economy… They’re on
a whole other level compared to Kamakura.</i></b>

04:42.617 --> 04:46.207
<b><i>So Takauji is vying for power
in a capital like this.</i></b>

04:48.037 --> 04:51.087
<b>Young Lord, we should get going.</b>

04:51.167 --> 04:52.167
<b>Right.</b>

04:52.707 --> 04:54.127
<b>Where could Genba be?</b>

04:54.627 --> 04:57.087
<b>Should we look around
where we saw him earlier?</b>

05:01.097 --> 05:03.727
<b>What's the matter, little fox?</b>

05:03.807 --> 05:07.597
<b>You're not just penniless.
You're 20 kanmon in debt.</b>

05:09.727 --> 05:14.947
<b>What a pushover.
I've never lost a game of dice.</b>

05:15.027 --> 05:16.317
<b>Genba!</b>

05:16.407 --> 05:18.407
<b>This is bad! He's barely alive!</b>

05:18.487 --> 05:20.327
<b>-Congratulations…
-The despair of losing at gambling</b>

05:20.407 --> 05:22.327
<b>-and being stripped of everything he had…
-Thank you…</b>

05:22.407 --> 05:24.907
<b>…combined with the thrill of playing
a game of dice stark naked</b>

05:24.997 --> 05:27.827
<b>under the woman's gaze,
has completely broken his mind!</b>

05:28.997 --> 05:32.837
<b>Are you his companions?
Too bad. He already belongs to me.</b>

05:33.417 --> 05:35.417
<b>A labor broker will be here
to collect him soon.</b>

05:35.507 --> 05:40.257
<b>He'll work off his debt
doing forced labor deep in Mount Hiei.</b>

05:41.097 --> 05:42.177
<b>Everyone, your money.</b>

05:45.887 --> 05:49.307
<b>We're country folk who have just arrived
and don't know how things work here yet.</b>

05:49.397 --> 05:52.107
<b>Would this be enough
for you to let him go?</b>

05:53.727 --> 05:54.987
<b>No deal.</b>

05:55.067 --> 05:58.567
<b>You settle a loss in battle with battle,
and a loss in gambling with gambling.</b>

05:58.657 --> 06:00.317
<b>That's the way of the world.</b>

06:00.947 --> 06:03.077
<b>Why don't you sit down at the board?</b>

06:03.157 --> 06:05.697
<b>Don't wager your money. Wager yourself.</b>

06:07.117 --> 06:08.827
<b>I don't know much about dice games,</b>

06:08.917 --> 06:11.037
<b>-but if someone can teach me as we go…
-Big Brother!</b>

06:13.497 --> 06:17.007
<b><i>He didn't hesitate to stake himself
for his retainer.</i></b>

06:17.087 --> 06:20.087
<b><i>And his retainers followed his lead
and put up the money without hesitation.</i></b>

06:20.177 --> 06:21.637
<b><i>Eastern warrior, huh?</i></b>

06:22.217 --> 06:25.347
<b><i>He may be a country boy,
but he must come from quite a family.</i></b>

06:27.267 --> 06:29.387
<b><i>How I love it…</i></b>

06:30.227 --> 06:33.647
<b><i>Taking a proud, innocent country warrior…</i></b>

06:36.607 --> 06:40.947
<b><i>and dragging him through the filth of Kyo
until he's utterly soiled.</i></b>

06:41.027 --> 06:42.027
<b>Step aside, Big Brother.</b>

06:43.367 --> 06:44.947
<b>I'll play her.</b>

06:45.037 --> 06:46.287
<b>Shizuku!</b>

06:48.747 --> 06:50.417
<b>How very touching!</b>

06:50.497 --> 06:52.667
<b>Devotion to your lord?
Love for your brother?</b>

06:52.747 --> 06:56.337
<b>Fine by me. I like it.
You're on, country shrine maiden.</b>

06:56.417 --> 06:59.837
<b>If you lose, you'll learn what it means
to be tainted so young.</b>

06:59.927 --> 07:02.137
<b>-You're fine with that, right?
-Of course.</b>

07:02.217 --> 07:03.467
<b>Hey, you.</b>

07:04.637 --> 07:07.057
<b>Take the money and leave it at that.</b>

07:07.137 --> 07:10.557
<b>A gambling dispute ends in bloodshed
wherever you go.</b>

07:11.227 --> 07:13.357
<b>You're just a girl with no fighting force
to back you up.</b>

07:13.437 --> 07:15.017
<b>Don't get greedy.</b>

07:25.327 --> 07:26.737
<b>I'm Mima.</b>

07:27.327 --> 07:30.077
<b>Doyo Sasaki's daughter.</b>

07:30.157 --> 07:32.497
<b>Everyone in Kyo knows who I am.</b>

07:34.537 --> 07:35.997
<b><i>Doyo Sasaki.</i></b>

07:36.087 --> 07:39.047
<b><i>A western warrior who wielded power
behind the scenes in Kyo.</i></b>

07:39.127 --> 07:42.757
<b><i>His reputation had reached as far as Suwa.</i></b>

07:43.467 --> 07:45.137
<b>All right, shall we begin?</b>

07:45.847 --> 07:47.257
<b>A country shrine maiden like you</b>

07:47.347 --> 07:49.767
<b>wouldn't know the more complicated
ways to play, would you?</b>

07:49.847 --> 07:52.017
<b>We'll play Willow, the simplest version.</b>

07:52.897 --> 07:56.107
<b><i>I could sense holy power in her hand
when she moved that piece.</i></b>

07:56.857 --> 07:59.897
<b><i>That means this will be
no ordinary game of dice.</i></b>

07:59.987 --> 08:02.027
<b>Go on. Roll the dice.</b>

08:02.607 --> 08:06.487
<b>These will take you
straight from Kyo to hell.</b>

08:09.697 --> 08:12.867
<b>Willow is an extremely simple
game of dice.</b>

08:13.577 --> 08:15.037
<b>We take turns rolling,</b>

08:15.127 --> 08:17.877
<b>and the first to move
all their pieces to the end wins.</b>

08:18.877 --> 08:21.217
<b>Obviously, the higher you roll,
the better.</b>

08:21.297 --> 08:23.337
<b>But you need an exact roll
to reach the end.</b>

08:23.427 --> 08:25.587
<b>Any excess sends the piece back
by that many spaces.</b>

08:26.507 --> 08:30.347
<b>In other words, it almost entirely
comes down to luck.</b>

08:32.677 --> 08:33.937
<b><i>Holy power.</i></b>

08:34.017 --> 08:35.437
<b><i>In the hands of an ordinary person,</i></b>

08:35.517 --> 08:37.357
<b><i>it might reveal
faint glimpses of the future</i></b>

08:37.437 --> 08:39.187
<b><i>or beings normally hidden from sight,</i></b>

08:39.267 --> 08:42.107
<b><i>or grant them
a small measure of good fortune.</i></b>

08:42.687 --> 08:47.567
<b><i>But even that slight power
can decide the outcome of a wager.</i></b>

08:51.247 --> 08:52.447
<b>Nice roll, Shizuku!</b>

08:54.867 --> 08:56.997
<b>So you can use it too.</b>

08:57.537 --> 08:59.287
<b>You get people like that sometimes.</b>

08:59.377 --> 09:02.507
<b>People who can nudge
the luck of the dice in their favor.</b>

09:02.587 --> 09:05.177
<b>Not even the Emperor
can control how they fall.</b>

09:05.257 --> 09:08.637
<b>Well, I'm in a league of my own.</b>

09:10.717 --> 09:11.717
<b>No…</b>

09:17.347 --> 09:19.017
<b>Stop…</b>

09:19.607 --> 09:22.397
<b>You can't… You can't beat her…</b>

09:23.107 --> 09:24.857
<b>Hey, country shrine maiden.</b>

09:25.487 --> 09:27.737
<b>I've got pretty good instincts, you know.</b>

09:27.817 --> 09:32.737
<b>You keep calling him ''Big Brother," but
that boy isn't really your brother, is he?</b>

09:32.827 --> 09:36.367
<b>And yet you're willing to
wager yourself in his place…</b>

09:36.457 --> 09:38.377
<b>Wait. Are you into him or something?</b>

09:41.747 --> 09:43.377
<b>No. Not at all.</b>

09:44.297 --> 09:47.377
<b>He's my lord,
so of course I'd take his place.</b>

09:47.467 --> 09:49.797
<b>But do I like him that way?
Absolutely, positively not.</b>

09:49.887 --> 09:50.887
<b>Harsh!</b>

09:51.927 --> 09:53.387
<b>I see.</b>

09:53.967 --> 09:58.477
<b>Then if I win this game,
maybe I'll claim the boy instead of you.</b>

09:59.097 --> 10:02.267
<b>He's actually kind of my type,
looks and personality.</b>

10:04.687 --> 10:08.027
<b><i>Holy power is influenced by
one's state of mind.</i></b>

10:09.027 --> 10:12.277
<b><i>Remain as serene as a god,
and holy power will gather around you.</i></b>

10:12.367 --> 10:15.537
<b><i>Let human emotions disturb your composure,
and it will slip away.</i></b>

10:16.117 --> 10:19.827
<b><i>In gambling, a bluff is a means of
shaking your opponent's composure</i></b>

10:19.917 --> 10:21.747
<b><i>and robbing them of holy power.</i></b>

10:32.427 --> 10:36.347
<b>This is incredible!
I've never seen a game of dice like this.</b>

10:36.427 --> 10:39.097
<b>Almost every roll is a six!</b>

10:42.147 --> 10:45.727
<b>But Shizuku's rolls
are consistently a little lower.</b>

10:47.437 --> 10:48.817
<b>And she's almost at the finish…</b>

10:50.107 --> 10:52.027
<b>Who is she?</b>

10:55.987 --> 10:57.407
<b>What's up with you lot?</b>

11:00.667 --> 11:01.997
<b>You've got nowhere to go?</b>

11:03.337 --> 11:06.707
<b>This is an age
when no one reveres the gods or Buddha.</b>

11:06.797 --> 11:10.427
<b>No wonder divine spirits like you
are left to wander.</b>

11:13.967 --> 11:18.347
<b>You want to come with me?
If you prove useful, I'll let you stay.</b>

11:25.397 --> 11:27.687
<b><i>That was when this power came to me.</i></b>

11:27.777 --> 11:33.197
<b><i>It's only a faint trace of power,
but used right, it could be incredible.</i></b>

11:34.237 --> 11:39.327
<b><i>I'll use this power to aid Father…
and that person in their grand ambitions!</i></b>

11:43.627 --> 11:45.587
<b>Big Brother, rest your head in my lap.</b>

11:45.667 --> 11:46.707
<b>Why?</b>

11:47.497 --> 11:48.507
<b>I don't know why,</b>

11:48.587 --> 11:51.297
<b>but when Shizuku suggests something
at a time like this, it's best to listen.</b>

11:54.757 --> 12:00.427
<b>Mima. Big Brother has a past
that makes me want to help him,</b>

12:00.517 --> 12:03.767
<b>and a future that makes him worth serving.</b>

12:07.687 --> 12:11.317
<b>Many retainers have the misfortune
of serving foolish lords.</b>

12:11.397 --> 12:14.947
<b>But I found a lord who is kind
and truly cares for his retainers.</b>

12:15.027 --> 12:16.697
<b>That makes me incredibly fortunate.</b>

12:17.447 --> 12:21.957
<b>That's why we, his retainers,
would give our lives to protect him.</b>

12:23.957 --> 12:26.497
<b>And there's one thing I lied about.</b>

12:34.377 --> 12:35.387
<b>I love him.</b>

12:36.597 --> 12:38.177
<b><i>What do you think you're doing,
country shrine maiden?</i></b>

12:38.257 --> 12:40.267
<b><i>Who confesses their feelings
in the middle of a game of dice?</i></b>

12:40.347 --> 12:44.767
<b><i>Wait… She's still making moves?</i></b>

12:44.847 --> 12:46.977
<b><i>Wait, you're taking it that far?</i></b>

12:47.057 --> 12:49.977
<b><i>She looks so calm,
but she's so passionate!</i></b>

12:50.567 --> 12:51.567
<b>Your turn.</b>

12:51.647 --> 12:52.737
<b>I know!</b>

12:55.987 --> 12:58.027
<b><i>I failed to get one piece to the end!</i></b>

12:58.117 --> 13:02.037
<b><i>No matter.
One exact roll on my next turn, and I win!</i></b>

13:03.537 --> 13:05.247
<b>She's been doing all that while playing!</b>

13:05.327 --> 13:07.747
<b>Even we've never played like that.</b>

13:07.827 --> 13:09.917
<b>Look! I've never seen a move like that!</b>

13:11.627 --> 13:15.547
<b><i>Damn it!
Why can't I roll the exact number I need?</i></b>

13:15.627 --> 13:17.717
<b><i>What is with this girl?</i></b>

13:17.797 --> 13:21.467
<b><i>I've never met anyone this outrageous,
not even in Kyo!</i></b>

13:25.387 --> 13:29.817
<b><i>Shizuku isn't closing the gap this quickly
because of luck alone.</i></b>

13:30.477 --> 13:33.067
<b><i>While everyone's attention
is fixed on her lips,</i></b>

13:33.147 --> 13:35.947
<b><i>she's palming other pieces
and sneaking them forward.</i></b>

13:36.527 --> 13:40.407
<b><i>She even factored cheating
into her strategy.</i></b>

13:40.987 --> 13:44.157
<b><i>Our steward is one formidable operator.</i></b>

13:44.787 --> 13:49.167
<b><i>This is bad. I'm losing my composure.
My luck is slipping away!</i></b>

13:51.547 --> 13:52.627
<b>I win.</b>

13:58.427 --> 14:01.717
<b>-Yes! We won!
-Genba retrieval successful!</b>

14:02.307 --> 14:04.927
<b>Sheesh. You really made us work for it.</b>

14:08.437 --> 14:10.307
<b>I'm saved!</b>

14:10.397 --> 14:11.687
<b>Learn your lesson!</b>

14:11.767 --> 14:12.937
<b>Yes…</b>

14:19.447 --> 14:22.487
<b>You can relax now, Big Brother. I won.</b>

14:23.907 --> 14:26.077
<b>You really did win! What happened?</b>

14:26.157 --> 14:27.497
<b>And just so we're clear…</b>

14:30.077 --> 14:34.167
<b>I don't like you, Big Brother.
Not in the slightest.</b>

14:36.377 --> 14:38.717
<b><i>Did I say something to upset her?</i></b>

14:40.337 --> 14:44.847
<b>Wait.
I can't let you walk away for nothing.</b>

14:44.927 --> 14:46.387
<b>Don't, Mima.</b>

14:46.477 --> 14:47.477
<b>Kojiro.</b>

14:47.557 --> 14:51.227
<b>Don't worry. If she draws her sword,
I'll take her head.</b>

14:51.307 --> 14:56.647
<b>You've got some wild retainers
serving you, huh, boy?</b>

14:57.857 --> 15:00.067
<b>I like you lot. Take it!</b>

15:01.107 --> 15:03.277
<b>You guys are quite the Basara yourselves!</b>

15:03.827 --> 15:05.117
<b>Basara?</b>

15:05.697 --> 15:08.077
<b>Sell that and live it up in Kyo.</b>

15:08.157 --> 15:10.327
<b>I can't have the people who defeated me
wandering around Kyo</b>

15:10.417 --> 15:11.827
<b>with nothing but pocket change.</b>

15:11.917 --> 15:14.797
<b>It would tarnish the name
of the prestigious Kyogoku-Sasaki clan.</b>

15:15.377 --> 15:17.967
<b>Let's have some fun, boy!
Just the two of us.</b>

15:18.047 --> 15:21.007
<b>I'll personally show you around Kyo.</b>

15:21.087 --> 15:22.847
<b>-Show me around?
-That's right!</b>

15:23.427 --> 15:26.807
<b>And tonight, you can stay at my residence.</b>

15:29.477 --> 15:32.017
<b>What was that for, you country bumpkins?</b>

15:32.097 --> 15:33.557
<b>Stay away from him, you pest.</b>

15:33.647 --> 15:35.767
<b>What are you planning to do
alone with him?</b>

15:35.857 --> 15:36.937
<b>What am I planning?</b>

15:37.687 --> 15:39.817
<b>That's none of your business…</b>

15:41.857 --> 15:46.197
<b>All right, all right! I get it! I get it!</b>

15:46.287 --> 15:50.207
<b>I'll show you all around!</b>

15:52.997 --> 15:54.877
<b>Chojumaru Koizumi…</b>

15:55.917 --> 15:58.047
<b>You're the son of a guard
at Suwa Grand Shrine?</b>

15:58.127 --> 16:03.007
<b>Yeah. I'm visiting the Suwa shrines
around Kyo to ask for donations.</b>

16:04.847 --> 16:07.757
<b>Suwa Grand Shrine has branch shrines
all over the country, after all.</b>

16:07.847 --> 16:11.847
<b>I thought you came from
a more prestigious family.</b>

16:11.937 --> 16:15.557
<b>You're not even in my father's league.</b>

16:15.647 --> 16:17.017
<b>I suppose not.</b>

16:17.107 --> 16:18.277
<b>Hey.</b>

16:18.357 --> 16:21.197
<b>If she's the daughter of a Kyo warrior,
she's on the enemy's side, right?</b>

16:21.737 --> 16:23.027
<b>Should be.</b>

16:23.107 --> 16:25.237
<b>Should we really be
hanging around with her?</b>

16:25.737 --> 16:28.117
<b>Who knows? If she gets
even slightly suspicious of us,</b>

16:28.197 --> 16:30.037
<b>we grab the Young Lord and get out fast.</b>

16:34.747 --> 16:36.877
<b>Those hakama pants
are enormous and flashy!</b>

16:37.417 --> 16:40.377
<b>They're okuchi bakama,
all the rage in Kyo right now.</b>

16:40.457 --> 16:45.087
<b>People who dress and act
in such outrageous ways are called Basara.</b>

16:45.177 --> 16:48.467
<b>So your bizarre outfit is Basara too?</b>

16:48.557 --> 16:49.557
<b>Exactly.</b>

16:50.057 --> 16:51.057
<b>Exhibitionist.</b>

16:51.137 --> 16:53.887
<b>Shut up! You're awfully harsh with me,
country shrine maiden!</b>

16:53.977 --> 16:57.857
<b><i>After overthrowing the Kamakura shogunate,
the warriors who entered Kyo</i></b>

16:57.937 --> 17:01.067
<b><i>began swaggering around
in outrageously flamboyant attire.</i></b>

17:01.647 --> 17:04.147
<b><i>Soon, even the nobles rushed
to imitate them.</i></b>

17:05.357 --> 17:06.987
<b><i>The trend was known as Basara.</i></b>

17:07.567 --> 17:11.327
<b><i>Created by the warrior class,
it was Japan's first fashion craze.</i></b>

17:11.997 --> 17:14.617
<b>And my father was the man behind it all.</b>

17:15.327 --> 17:18.537
<b>Forget those outdated ideas
of what a warrior should be, boy.</b>

17:18.627 --> 17:20.997
<b>The times are changing,
and so are the old rules.</b>

17:21.087 --> 17:23.667
<b>Now the world belongs to
those who live as they please.</b>

17:25.257 --> 17:27.047
<b>Come on, sucker!</b>

17:27.137 --> 17:30.057
<b>You country samurai too! Let's go!</b>

17:30.757 --> 17:33.427
<b>Kyo's too vast to see in a single day.</b>

17:33.517 --> 17:35.937
<b>It'll take you a month to see it all,
so brace yourselves!</b>

17:38.057 --> 17:42.147
<b><i>Once she takes a liking to someone,
she shows it openly.</i></b>

17:43.067 --> 17:45.447
<b><i>I feel guilty about hiding
my true identity from her.</i></b>

17:45.527 --> 17:47.067
<b><i>But for now, I'll use her generosity</i></b>

17:47.157 --> 17:49.317
<b><i>as a chance to learn
as much about Kyo as I can.</i></b>

17:49.407 --> 17:52.487
<b>I can't walk another step!
Let's go to the inn!</b>

17:52.577 --> 17:55.037
<b>Your stamina is pathetic!</b>

17:55.117 --> 17:57.707
<b>The best of Kyo is still to come…</b>

17:58.787 --> 17:59.787
<b>Hey.</b>

18:01.957 --> 18:04.127
<b>Apologize, girl.</b>

18:04.207 --> 18:06.837
<b>How dare you parade around
in such indecent attire?</b>

18:07.427 --> 18:08.427
<b>Oopsie!</b>

18:14.097 --> 18:17.727
<b>Good grief. Kyo is rotten to the core.</b>

18:17.807 --> 18:20.557
<b>You can't get a fair judgment anymore,</b>

18:20.647 --> 18:23.357
<b>and warriors and young girls alike
dress indecently.</b>

18:26.317 --> 18:28.447
<b>You've got country bumpkin
written all over you,</b>

18:28.527 --> 18:30.367
<b>drinking and ranting in broad daylight.</b>

18:32.077 --> 18:36.407
<b>You must be another eastern warrior who
never received a reward for his service.</b>

18:36.497 --> 18:39.787
<b>I see losers like you every day.</b>

18:41.037 --> 18:42.127
<b>Hey…</b>

18:42.997 --> 18:44.547
<b>You're one of Nitta's men.</b>

18:47.627 --> 18:48.797
<b><i>Yoshisada Nitta!</i></b>

18:49.547 --> 18:51.597
<b><i>The man who led the assault on Kamakura!</i></b>

18:54.637 --> 18:56.557
<b>Poor thing!</b>

18:56.637 --> 18:59.227
<b>Your lord Yoshisada is such an idiot</b>

18:59.307 --> 19:03.227
<b>that his own retainers don't even benefit
from the Emperor's favor.</b>

19:04.567 --> 19:08.527
<b>You little brat.
You must have a death wish.</b>

19:09.107 --> 19:10.277
<b>Mima!</b>

19:10.357 --> 19:11.817
<b>It's fine. Go ahead.</b>

19:11.907 --> 19:13.737
<b>Hit me, cut me, whatever you like.</b>

19:14.367 --> 19:16.367
<b>I'm the daughter of a Kyo warrior family.</b>

19:16.447 --> 19:19.247
<b>You think I'd back down
from some country samurai?</b>

19:19.327 --> 19:22.247
<b>Father will pay you back
a thousandfold anyway.</b>

19:24.707 --> 19:26.047
<b>Kojiro. Ayako.</b>

19:26.627 --> 19:29.257
<b>Before this causes a commotion,
can you take him down?</b>

19:30.217 --> 19:31.257
<b>Of course.</b>

19:31.337 --> 19:32.927
<b>We'll follow your lead, My Lord.</b>

19:34.507 --> 19:36.427
<b>You dare underestimate me…</b>

19:36.517 --> 19:39.687
<b>I took three heads
in the assault on Kamakura!</b>

19:56.737 --> 19:59.077
<b>You're a young lady
from a distinguished family.</b>

19:59.157 --> 20:01.537
<b>It would be terrible
if your face were scarred.</b>

20:02.957 --> 20:05.337
<b>Though I suppose
that way of thinking is old-fashioned too.</b>

20:06.207 --> 20:09.297
<b>Perhaps I'm simply not cut out for Basara.</b>

20:09.377 --> 20:12.297
<b>Yikes! He stinks of booze!</b>

20:12.377 --> 20:15.467
<b>Guess he was all talk, My Lord.</b>

20:17.137 --> 20:20.097
<b><i>Why are you so damn earnest?
You're gonna be the death of women!</i></b>

20:20.177 --> 20:23.227
<b><i>You're so straitlaced,
it's almost basara in its own way…</i></b>

20:24.347 --> 20:27.107
<b><i>I've got to introduce this guy to Father.</i></b>

20:30.027 --> 20:33.907
<b>Yes, yes. So that's what happened.</b>

20:36.987 --> 20:41.157
<b>I can't bear it anymore!
Yet again, I nearly died!</b>

20:41.247 --> 20:44.877
<b>I see. You must have been terrified.</b>

20:45.997 --> 20:48.047
<b>My Battle Mikoshi was smashed to pieces.</b>

20:48.127 --> 20:50.877
<b>I exhausted my personal fortune
hiring mighty warriors.</b>

20:50.957 --> 20:53.877
<b>And the Emperor will not even see me.</b>

20:53.967 --> 20:56.137
<b>I want no more of war!</b>

20:59.677 --> 21:05.977
<b>However useless a person may be, their
life is still precious and irreplaceable.</b>

21:06.057 --> 21:09.477
<b>We must wring every last bit of use out
of them until they're completely worn out,</b>

21:09.567 --> 21:12.897
<b>or surely the Buddha would be angered.</b>

21:16.407 --> 21:17.487
<b>Sir Kiyohara.</b>

21:19.827 --> 21:22.247
<b>You need not be afraid anymore.</b>

21:25.287 --> 21:29.207
<b>Leave everything to me,
and all will be well.</b>

21:30.127 --> 21:33.507
<b>Now, slowly close your eyes.</b>

21:38.217 --> 21:39.637
<b>That smile…</b>

21:40.557 --> 21:44.097
<b>How it puts my heart at ease…</b>

21:47.517 --> 21:48.897
<b>So much more…</b>

21:49.687 --> 21:51.147
<b>than the Emperor…</b>

23:32.817 --> 23:34.937
<b>MIMA SASAKI
VOICED BY NIINA HANAMIYA</b>

23:38.787 --> 23:39.837
<b><i>Let's go!</i></b>

23:38.967 --> 23:39.837
<b>EPISODE 21 (1335): THE MAN
CALLED MASASHIGE KUSUNOKI</b>
